#. Empty-state explanation in the screen-share picker displays tab on Linux/Wayland. Technical surface; keep 'xdg-desktop-portal' as a literal proper noun.
#: src/features/voice/components/modals/screen_share_picker_modal/useNativePickerCopy.ts
msgid "Wayland's xdg-desktop-portal owns the picker and shows every window and display together. There is no flag that filters it to displays only. Press \"Open system picker\", then choose a display there to capture desktop audio."
msgstr "A Wayland, el selector el gestiona xdg-desktop-portal i mostra totes les finestres i pantalles juntes. No hi ha cap opció per filtrar-hi només les pantalles. Prem «Obre el selector del sistema» i tria-hi una pantalla per capturar l'àudio de l'escriptori."

#. Empty-state explanation in the screen-share picker apps tab on Linux/Wayland. Technical surface; keep 'xdg-desktop-portal' as a literal proper noun.
#: src/features/voice/components/modals/screen_share_picker_modal/useNativePickerCopy.ts
msgid "Wayland's xdg-desktop-portal owns the picker and shows every window and display together. There is no flag that filters it to windows only. Press \"Open system picker\", then choose a window there to get per-app audio."
msgstr "A Wayland, el selector el gestiona xdg-desktop-portal i mostra totes les finestres i pantalles juntes. No hi ha cap opció per filtrar-hi només les finestres. Prem «Obre el selector del sistema» i tria-hi una finestra per obtenir l'àudio de l'aplicació."

#. Hint under the checkbox "Welcome me in #operators" in the dialog where a Visionary turns on the Operator Pass that comes with Visionary. Turn on your pass means the button in that dialog that switches the pass on, nothing is bought. Fluxer Labs is the name of a community on Fluxer, keep it as is. #operators is a channel there, keep it as is. Left or were removed from Fluxer Labs before means the person left the Fluxer Labs community, or was removed from it, at any time in the past.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassLabsGreetingField.tsx
msgid "We add you to Fluxer Labs when you turn on your pass, unless you left or were removed from Fluxer Labs before. With this on, we welcome you by name in #operators soon after."
msgstr "T'afegim a Fluxer Labs quan actives el passi, tret que abans hagis sortit de Fluxer Labs o te n'hagin tret. Amb aquesta opció activada, et donem la benvinguda pel teu nom a #operators poc després."

#. Hint under the checkbox or switch "Welcome me in #operators". Fluxer Labs is the name of a community on Fluxer, keep it as is. #operators is a channel there, keep it as is. Left or were removed from Fluxer Labs before means the person left the Fluxer Labs community, or was removed from it, at any time in the past.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassLabsGreetingField.tsx
msgid "We add you to Fluxer Labs when your pass is delivered, unless you left or were removed from Fluxer Labs before. With this on, we welcome you by name in #operators soon after."
msgstr "T'afegim a Fluxer Labs quan es lliura el passi, tret que abans hagis sortit de Fluxer Labs o te n'hagin tret. Amb aquesta opció activada, et donem la benvinguda pel teu nom a #operators poc després."

#. Error under the certificate name fields when the server turned a name down, for example because it looks like it comes from Fluxer or another brand, or because it has characters such as emoji that the certificate cannot print. Never say which rule matched.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassCertificateNamesField.tsx
