msgstr "No podem imprimir aquest nom en un certificat. Tria'n un altre."

#. Error under the Operators' wall name field when the server turned the name down, for example because it looks like it comes from Fluxer or another brand. Never say which rule matched.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassWallNameField.tsx
msgid "We can't show this name on the Operators' wall. Please choose another one."
msgstr "No podem mostrar aquest nom al mur dels Operators. Tria'n un altre."

