msgstr "El teu kit de recuperació"

#. Success toast shown after a self-serve Plutonium refund is issued. "Business days" means working days, not weekends or holidays.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/RefundsSection.tsx
msgid "Your refund has been issued. It can take a few business days before you see the money."
msgstr "S'ha emès el reemborsament. Pot trigar uns quants dies laborables a arribar-te els diners."

#. Short label in the region display names. Keep it concise.
#: src/features/user/utils/UserGeo.ts
msgid "your region"
msgstr "la teva regió"

#. Plutonium subscription card text shown while a failed renewal payment is being retried. {graceDate} is a date already formatted and localized by code; never write a date into the translation.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/SubscriptionDescription.tsx
msgid "Your renewal payment failed but <0/> stay active until <1>{graceDate}</1>. Update your payment method before then to keep your subscription."
msgstr "Ha fallat el pagament de renovació, però <0/> continuen actius fins al <1>{graceDate}</1>. Actualitza el mètode de pagament abans d'aquesta data per conservar la subscripció."

#. Report flow: note on the summary screen when sending the report failed for an unknown reason.
#: src/features/moderation/components/report_flow/ReportFlowCopy.ts
msgid "Your report didn't go through. Try again."
msgstr "La denúncia no s'ha pogut enviar. Torna-ho a provar."

#. Video settings note shown when the saved screen share quality is above what this account can send. Resolutions are short labels such as 1440p or Source and rates are whole numbers. FPS is a technical token.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/UserVideoTab.tsx
msgid "Your saved {savedResolution} at {savedFrameRate} FPS needs {premiumProductName}, so shares use {resolution} at {frameRate} FPS."
msgstr "La qualitat desada de {savedResolution} a {savedFrameRate} FPS requereix {premiumProductName}, així que es comparteix a {resolution} a {frameRate} FPS."

#. Body of a modal shown when the video codec the browser negotiated for an active screen share is outside the codecs the app allows and no allowed codec could be published, which forces the share to stop.
#: src/features/voice/engine/v2/VoiceEngineV2AppScreenShareExecutionAdapter.tsx
msgctxt "screen-share"
msgid "Your screen share could not be published with a compatible video codec, so it was stopped. Try sharing again."
msgstr "No s'ha pogut publicar la compartició de pantalla amb un còdec de vídeo compatible, així que s'ha aturat. Torna a provar de compartir."

#. Footer summary under the preset name in the web stream setup modal when the Source resolution is picked. {fps} is a whole number of frames per second, and FPS is a technical token.
#: src/features/voice/components/modals/screen_share_picker_modal/WebStreamSetupModal.tsx
msgid "Your screen's resolution at {fps} FPS"
msgstr "La resolució de la teva pantalla a {fps} FPS"

#. Alert on the setup token screen when the token was refused while creating the account.
#: src/features/app/components/setup/SelfHostedSetupWizardGate.tsx
msgid "Your setup token stopped working. Enter it again."
msgstr "El teu token de configuració ha deixat de funcionar. Torna'l a introduir."

#. Explanation shown in place of the single sign-on description when the instance requires single sign-on but cannot connect to its sign-in provider right now.
#: src/features/auth/flow/AuthSsoPanel.tsx
msgid "Your sign-in provider is unavailable. Try again later."
msgstr "El teu proveïdor d'inici de sessió no està disponible. Torna-ho a provar més tard."

#. Description of the password row in account settings when the instance requires single sign-on and the sign-in provider manages the account's email and password.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/account_security_tab/AccountTab.tsx
msgid "Your sign-in provider manages your email and password."
msgstr "El teu proveïdor d'inici de sessió gestiona la teva adreça electrònica i la contrasenya."

#. Subtitle under the preview-paused overlay reassuring the user that the screen share is still live for others.
#: src/features/voice/components/voice_participant_tile/shared.ts
msgid "Your stream is still live"
msgstr "La teva transmissió continua en directe"

#. Toast error shown when the server refuses to move a Plutonium subscription down to the current price, whatever the reason.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription can't move to the new price right now."
msgstr "Ara mateix la teva subscripció no pot passar al preu nou."

#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/SubscriptionDescription.tsx
msgid "Your subscription ended but <0/> stay active until <1>{graceDate}</1>. Resubscribe before then to keep your subscriber history."
msgstr "La teva subscripció s'ha acabat, però <0/> continuen actius fins al <1>{graceDate}</1>. Torna't a subscriure abans d'aquesta data per conservar el teu historial de subscriptor."

#. Sentence in the dialog that withdraws from a paid Plutonium subscription. Withdrawing refunds every payment for it and ends the subscription right away.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassWithdrawModal.tsx
msgid "Your subscription ends now."
msgstr "La teva subscripció s'acaba ara."

#. Body text in the Plutonium subscription actions. Keep the tone plain and specific.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription has been reactivated."
msgstr "S'ha reactivat la teva subscripció."

#. Toast success shown after a Plutonium subscription is set to cancel at the end of the billing period.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription has been set to cancel at the end of your billing period."
msgstr "La teva subscripció es cancel·larà al final del període de facturació."

#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/SubscriptionDescription.tsx
msgid "Your subscription is active but perks are temporarily paused."
msgstr "La teva subscripció està activa, però els avantatges estan en pausa temporalment."

#. Body of the error modal shown when a subscription is already scheduled to cancel.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/utils/PremiumActionErrorModal.tsx
msgid "Your subscription is already set to cancel at the end of your billing period."
msgstr "La teva subscripció ja està configurada per cancel·lar-se al final del període de facturació."

#. Body of the error modal shown when reactivation is attempted but the subscription is not cancelling.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/utils/PremiumActionErrorModal.tsx
msgid "Your subscription isn't set to cancel, so there's nothing to reactivate."
msgstr "La teva subscripció no està configurada per cancel·lar-se, així que no hi ha res a reactivar."

#. Toast success shown after a Plutonium subscription is scheduled to move down to the current price. {effectiveDate} is the localized date the new price starts.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription moves to the new price on {effectiveDate}."
msgstr "La teva subscripció passarà al preu nou el {effectiveDate}."

#. Plutonium subscription card line shown to a subscriber on a legacy price whose subscription is already set to cancel. {cancelDate} is a date and {listPriceNewLabel} is a currency amount, both already formatted and localized by code; never write a date or an amount into the translation.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/SubscriptionCard.tsx
msgid "Your subscription still ends on <0>{cancelDate}</0>. The current price is now {listPriceNewLabel}. If you reactivate, you can switch to it from here."
msgstr "La teva subscripció continua acabant-se el <0>{cancelDate}</0>. El preu actual ara és {listPriceNewLabel}. Si la reactives, pots canviar-hi des d'aquí."

#. Toast success shown after a Plutonium subscription is scheduled to switch to monthly billing.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription will switch to monthly billing at the next renewal."
msgstr "La teva subscripció passarà a facturació mensual a la propera renovació."

#. Toast success shown after a Plutonium subscription is scheduled to switch to yearly billing.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription will switch to yearly billing at the next renewal."
msgstr "La teva subscripció passarà a facturació anual a la propera renovació."

#. Inline informational note in the screen share picker on Linux systems where no hardware video encoder is available, for example NVIDIA-only machines. Not an error.
#: src/features/voice/components/modals/screen_share_picker_modal/SoftwareEncodeNotice.tsx
msgid "Your system has no hardware video encoder that {productName} can use, so screen sharing uses software encoding."
msgstr "El teu sistema no té cap codificador de vídeo per maquinari que {productName} pugui fer servir, així que la compartició de pantalla fa servir codificació per programari."

#. Body of the error modal shown when a theme CSS exceeds the maximum shareable size.
#: src/features/theme/components/modals/ShareThemeModal.tsx
msgid "Your theme CSS is too large to share. Trim it down and try again."
msgstr "El CSS del teu tema és massa gran per compartir-lo. Redueix-lo i torna-ho a provar."

#. Section title in Settings > Themes listing the CSS theme files the user imported.
#: src/features/user/components/settings_utils/section_registry/ThemesSections.ts
msgid "Your themes"
msgstr "Els teus temes"

#. Tooltip on the disabled Change username button when the sign-in provider sets usernames. Keep the tone plain and specific.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/my_profile_tab/MyProfileTabUsernameSection.tsx
msgid "Your username comes from your sign-in provider."
msgstr "El teu nom d'usuari prové del teu proveïdor d'inici de sessió."

#. Success toast after removing a community vanity invite URL.
#: src/features/guild/components/modals/guild_tabs/GuildVanityURLTab.tsx
msgid "Your vanity URL has been removed."
msgstr "S'ha eliminat el teu enllaç d'invitació personalitzat."

#. Success toast after saving a community vanity invite URL. inviteEndpoint is the deployment invite URL base; vanitySlug is the custom invite slug.
#: src/features/guild/components/modals/guild_tabs/GuildVanityURLTab.tsx
msgid "Your vanity URL has been set to {inviteEndpoint}/{vanitySlug}"
msgstr "S'ha definit el teu enllaç d'invitació personalitzat com a {inviteEndpoint}/{vanitySlug}"

#. Body of a modal shown when the local video encoder produces no frames for an active screen share, which forces the share to stop.
#: src/features/voice/engine/v2/VoiceEngineV2AppScreenShareExecutionAdapter.tsx
msgctxt "screen-share"
msgid "Your video encoder stopped encoding frames, so your screen share was stopped. Try sharing again."
msgstr "El codificador de vídeo ha deixat de codificar fotogrames, així que s'ha aturat la compartició de pantalla. Torna a provar de compartir."

#. Line in the Operator Pass settings for a Visionary who has not turned on the Operator Pass that comes with Visionary yet. A Turn on button follows it. Visionary and Operator Pass are product names, keep them as is. You pay nothing more means turning it on costs nothing on top of what they paid for Visionary, never use a word that means free or included.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassHoldingsSection.tsx
msgid "Your Visionary comes with an Operator Pass. You pay nothing more to turn it on, and nothing about your Visionary changes."
msgstr "El teu Visionary inclou un Operator Pass. No has de pagar res més per activar-lo i no canvia res del teu Visionary."

#. Line in the dialog where a Visionary turns on the Operator Pass that comes with Visionary, shown when the account is not in {labsName}, the community name. Operator is a role name and #operators a channel name, keep both as is.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassVisionaryModal.tsx
msgid "Your Visionary gives you #operators in {labsName} once you join with this account. After you turn on your Operator Pass, joining also gives you the Operator role."
msgstr "El teu Visionary et dona #operators a {labsName} quan t'hi uneixes amb aquest compte. Després d'activar l'Operator Pass, en unir-te també obtens el rol Operator."

#. Label for the YouTube Data API key field. YouTube Data API is a product name.
#: src/features/app/components/setup/SetupServicesStep.tsx
msgid "YouTube Data API key"
msgstr "Clau de l'API de dades de YouTube"

#. Review row label for YouTube link previews.
#: src/features/app/components/setup/SetupWizardSteps.tsx
msgid "YouTube previews"
msgstr "Previsualitzacions de YouTube"

